NAME='Saturn'
COVER_SUB='Where you build, fear and mature in each sign.'
T=[
("Fall","Saturn is in its fall in Aries: discipline and spontaneity pull against each other. You learn to act with responsibility, and early on you may feel that initiative is risky or that you must do things alone. With time you become a self-made leader. The shadow is fear of starting and harshness with yourself. The lesson: courage is a skill you can practise."),
("Steady","Saturn in Taurus builds slowly and surely. You value security, material stability and hard work, and you are patient and reliable. Fear centres on money, possessions and loss. The shadow is rigidity and clinging. The lesson: real security cannot be stored."),
("Disciplined mind","Saturn in Gemini disciplines the mind. You learn through effort, think carefully and communicate with seriousness. You may have felt slow or doubted your intelligence when young, but become an exact thinker. The shadow is anxiety and saying less than you know. The lesson: your voice is worth using."),
("Detriment","Saturn in Cancer is in detriment: duty meets feeling. You may have felt a lack of warmth or protection early on, and you work to build a safe home. You take family responsibility seriously. The shadow is emotional coldness, fear of dependence and defensiveness. The lesson: allow yourself to receive care."),
("Detriment","Saturn in Leo is in detriment: discipline meets the need to shine. You may feel unseen or afraid of being judged, and you work hard to earn recognition. You become a serious, dignified creator. The shadow is self-doubt and pride. The lesson: you can be seen without being perfect."),
("Methodical","Saturn in Virgo works with care, method and humility. You are conscientious, practical and a skilled craftsperson. Duty and health come first. The shadow is perfectionism, anxiety and overwork. The lesson: rest is part of the process."),
("Exalted","Saturn is exalted in Libra: justice, structure and balance. You are fair, serious about commitment and attentive to responsibilities in relationships. Maturity comes through partnership and contracts. The shadow is fear of conflict and loneliness. The lesson: loyalty is built through honest conversations."),
("Intense","Saturn in Scorpio faces depth, power and fear. You handle crisis calmly, keep secrets and gain strength through transformation. You do not trust easily and you do not forget. The shadow is control and emotional armour. The lesson: trust is a risk worth taking."),
("Serious","Saturn in Sagittarius takes beliefs seriously. You build your philosophy through study, discipline and experience, and you distrust easy answers. Growth comes slowly and lasts. The shadow is dogma and fear of the unknown. The lesson: faith can include doubt."),
("Own sign","Saturn is at home in Capricorn: structure, ambition and endurance. You are a disciplined planner, patient climber and a natural authority. You carry responsibility early and thrive with age. The shadow is coldness, rigidity and overwork. The lesson: authority is strongest when it is humane."),
("Own sign","Saturn is also at home in Aquarius: discipline serves ideas and community. You are an organised reformer, building systems that last, with respect for rules that serve people. The shadow is detachment and rigid thinking. The lesson: tradition and innovation can work together."),
("Compassionate","Saturn in Pisces gives form to the formless. You turn compassion and imagination into practical service, and you can feel the weight of other people’s suffering. Faith has to be tested before it is trusted. The shadow is fear, escapism and isolation. The lesson: boundaries make compassion sustainable."),
]
